## Development

Run from this package directory after installing workspace dependencies:

```sh
pnpm run build:check
pnpm run build
pnpm run test --runInBand
```

Source belongs in `src/`; tests belong in `test/` and use `*.spec.ts` filenames.
Add source and tests before running these commands. Workspace setup and release
commands are documented in the [development guide](../../docs/development.md).
